          "docs": "Replaces the product definition inputs for a signal definition.  \nOnce updated, the signal definition will enter the “Processing” state. \n\n* **Updates to product definition inputs will cause a signal definition’s “topics” collection to be \noverwritten before returning to the “Available” state.**\n"
